{"seq":1,"slug":"syndication-topology-source-of-truth","title":"分发拓扑与商品主数据真相源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/syndication-model-channel-catalog/syndication-topology-source-of-truth","wordCount":2658,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"分发拓扑与商品主数据真相源\">分发拓扑与商品主数据真相源</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多渠道分发（syndication）的本质，是把同一个商品在<strong>一个真相源</strong>里维护、<strong>多份渠道副本</strong>上呈现的问题。它之所以难，不在于传输，而在于「同一个 SKU 在 Google Shopping、Meta 目录、TikTok Shop、Amazon 与经销商 GDSN 数据池里，究竟谁说了算」。如果每个渠道各自维护一份商品数据，交叉销售就会出现价格打架、库存超卖、GTIN 冲突；如果强行只留一份数据，渠道特有的类目、尺寸、合规字段又无处安放。</p>\n<p>因此工程上把它拆成两个互相约束的东西：<strong>拓扑</strong>（谁向谁分发、按什么节奏、用什么协议）与<strong>真相源分层</strong>（哪一层对哪个属性有最终裁决权）。拓扑决定传播的延迟与失败面，真相源分层决定冲突时保留哪一份值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    ERP[&quot;ERP / MDM&lt;br/&gt;物料主数据 · GTIN · 成本&quot;] --&gt; MDM[&quot;主数据层&lt;br/&gt;Golden Record&quot;]&#10;    PIM[&quot;PIM 商品内容层&lt;br/&gt;富文本 · 图片 · 属性&quot;] --&gt; MDM&#10;    MDM --&gt; RULES[&quot;分发规则引擎&lt;br/&gt;渠道能力矩阵 · 字段映射&quot;]&#10;    RULES --&gt; GMC[&quot;Google Merchant Center&lt;br/&gt;feed / Content API&quot;]&#10;    RULES --&gt; META[&quot;Meta 目录&lt;br/&gt;batch / catalog API&quot;]&#10;    RULES --&gt; TK[&quot;TikTok Shop&lt;br/&gt;商品 API&quot;]&#10;    RULES --&gt; DS[&quot;经销商 / GDSN 数据池&lt;br/&gt;1WorldSync · Syndigo&quot;]&#10;    GMC -.-&gt;|&quot;回执 ack / 拒审原因&quot;| OPS[&quot;对账与异常队列&quot;]&#10;    META -.-&gt;|&quot;回执&quot;| OPS&#10;    TK -.-&gt;|&quot;回执&quot;| OPS&#10;    OPS --&gt; MDM\">graph TD\n    ERP[\"ERP / MDM&lt;br/&gt;物料主数据 · GTIN · 成本\"] --&gt; MDM[\"主数据层&lt;br/&gt;Golden Record\"]\n    PIM[\"PIM 商品内容层&lt;br/&gt;富文本 · 图片 · 属性\"] --&gt; MDM\n    MDM --&gt; RULES[\"分发规则引擎&lt;br/&gt;渠道能力矩阵 · 字段映射\"]\n    RULES --&gt; GMC[\"Google Merchant Center&lt;br/&gt;feed / Content API\"]\n    RULES --&gt; META[\"Meta 目录&lt;br/&gt;batch / catalog API\"]\n    RULES --&gt; TK[\"TikTok Shop&lt;br/&gt;商品 API\"]\n    RULES --&gt; DS[\"经销商 / GDSN 数据池&lt;br/&gt;1WorldSync · Syndigo\"]\n    GMC -.-&gt;|\"回执 ack / 拒审原因\"| OPS[\"对账与异常队列\"]\n    META -.-&gt;|\"回执\"| OPS\n    TK -.-&gt;|\"回执\"| OPS\n    OPS --&gt; MDM</pre><p>上图里有两条经常被忽视的回边：<strong>回执流</strong>。渠道不是被动接收方——Google 会因为 GTIN 校验位错误而拒收整个 item，Meta 会因为 <code>image_link</code> 返回 404 而冻结商品，GDSN 数据池会回传验证报告（Validation Report）。没有回执闭环的拓扑只是单向广播系统。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拓扑形态</th>\n<th>数据流向</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>失败影响面</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中心辐射（hub-and-spoke）</td>\n<td>PIM → 各渠道单向推送</td>\n<td>低（分钟级）</td>\n<td>单渠道隔离，中心故障则全体停摆</td>\n<td>渠道多、字段映射差异大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点对点 mesh</td>\n<td>渠道之间直连</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>一处错误全网扩散</td>\n<td>渠道少且强耦合（罕见）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件驱动（事件总线 + 消费者）</td>\n<td>变更事件 → 各渠道适配器</td>\n<td>中（秒到分钟）</td>\n<td>消费端可独立重放</td>\n<td>高变更频率、需要重放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拉取式（channel pull）</td>\n<td>渠道定时抓取 feed URL</td>\n<td>高（小时级）</td>\n<td>渠道侧可控，中心压力小</td>\n<td>中小商家、静态目录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中心辐射加事件驱动是 2026 年的主流组合：PIM 发布 <code>ProductUpdated</code> 事件，各渠道适配器作为独立消费者，各自负责字段映射、限流与重试，互不阻塞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"真相源分层与-golden-record-建模\">真相源分层与 Golden Record 建模</h2><p>「唯一真相源」在实践中不是一张表，而是<strong>按属性划分的五层裁决权</strong>。把每一层想象成一个 owner：当冲突发生，往上追溯到第一个声明拥有该属性的层为止。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性族</th>\n<th>裁决层</th>\n<th>典型系统</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>识别键（GTIN/GLN/SKU）</td>\n<td>MDM（全局）</td>\n<td>ERP + GS1 注册</td>\n<td>一经分配不可变更，是跨渠道 join 的唯一锚点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌/制造商/型号</td>\n<td>MDM</td>\n<td>ERP / 供应商主数据</td>\n<td>多供应商同名商品必须在此去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类目/包装/规格</td>\n<td>PIM</td>\n<td>PIM</td>\n<td>影响渠道映射，需版本化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>营销内容（标题/描述/图片）</td>\n<td>PIM 渠道视图</td>\n<td>PIM</td>\n<td>允许渠道差异化副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格/库存/促销</td>\n<td>渠道或定价引擎</td>\n<td>渠道自有</td>\n<td>变动最快，通常不走 PIM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>识别键这一层必须最先定死。GS1 体系里，GTIN-13 用于零售单品、GTIN-14 用于装箱层级，前 12 位由厂商前缀加商品参考码构成，最后一位是模 10 校验位。校验位可以用公式独立验算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mtext> odd</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mtext> even</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = (10 - ((3\\sum_{i \\text{ odd}} d_i + \\sum_{i \\text{ even}} d_i) \\bmod 10)) \\bmod 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"> odd</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"> even</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>任何渠道拒收，先算一遍校验位再怀疑数据管道——这是最常见的假故障。Google Merchant Center 要求 <code>gtin</code> 单值最多 14 位数字、空格和连字符被忽略，并声明错误的 GTIN 或 MPN 会导致商品被拒（来源：Google Merchant Center 商品数据规范，support.google.com/merchants/answer/7052112）。schema.org 的 <code>Product</code> 类型同样把 <code>gtin</code> 定义为 8/12/13/14 位数字串或 GS1 Digital Link URL（来源：schema.org/Product）。</p>\n<p>Golden Record 的生成通常走概率式或确定性匹配：确定性匹配按键（GTIN、品牌+MPN）连接，概率匹配用标题相似度加阈值。后者必须配一个人工仲裁队列（data steward queue），否则错误的合并会在所有渠道上同时放大。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>match</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mtext>GTIN</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>GTIN</mtext><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>否则</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{match}(a,b) = \\begin{cases} 1 &amp; \\text{GTIN}_a = \\text{GTIN}_b \\\\ \\alpha \\cdot \\text{sim}(t_a,t_b) + \\beta \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[b_a = b_b] &amp; \\text{否则} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">match</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GTIN</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GTIN</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">否则</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是归一化标题，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是品牌，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha + \\beta = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>；典型做法是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>match</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{match} &gt; 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">match</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span> 自动合并、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.7</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.7 \\sim 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span> 转人工、低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span></span></span></span></span> 视为不同商品。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道目录与能力矩阵\">渠道目录与能力矩阵</h2><p>渠道目录（channel catalog）不是一张渠道清单，而是<strong>每个渠道对商品数据的契约集合</strong>：需要哪些 ID、字段长度上限、允许的枚举值、图片规格、回执格式。它必须被建模成可查询的数据，而不是散落在适配器代码里的 if-else。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>主识别键</th>\n<th>标题上限</th>\n<th>描述上限</th>\n<th>图片要求</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Google Merchant Center</td>\n<td><code>id</code>（≤50 字符）</td>\n<td>150 字符</td>\n<td>5000 字符</td>\n<td>最小 500×500 像素（2027-01-31 起强制）</td>\n<td><code>price</code> 用 ISO 4217（如 <code>15.00 USD</code>）；<code>availability</code> 限 <code>in_stock/out_of_stock/preorder/backorder</code>；<code>brand</code> ≤70 字符；<code>condition</code> 对二手/翻新商品必填</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meta 目录</td>\n<td><code>id</code> + <code>retailer_id</code></td>\n<td>200 字符</td>\n<td>5000 字符</td>\n<td>无白边、无水印</td>\n<td>与 Meta Pixel 的 <code>content_id</code> 必须一致，否则归因断裂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TikTok Shop</td>\n<td>商品 ID / GTIN</td>\n<td>按类目模板</td>\n<td>按类目模板</td>\n<td>主图无文字</td>\n<td>类目属性模板强校验，上架即返回 attribute 缺失列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td>ASIN / GTIN</td>\n<td>200 字符</td>\n<td>2000 字符</td>\n<td>主图纯白底</td>\n<td>品牌需审核，<code>brand</code> 与 GTIN 需归属一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经销商 / GDSN 数据池</td>\n<td>GTIN + GLN</td>\n<td>按属性字典</td>\n<td>按属性字典</td>\n<td>按目标市场法规</td>\n<td>走 GS1 属性字典（GDSN）逐字段校验，回传 Validation Report</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张矩阵揭示了一个工程事实：<strong>同一个标题字段，在五个渠道上有五种长度和五种禁用规则</strong>。因此渠道目录的数据模型至少要包含 <code>channel × field → {required, maxLength, enumValues, transform, sourceLayer}</code> 四元组。当 Google 在 2027-01-31 把主图最小尺寸提到 500×500 时，运维只需改矩阵里的一行，而不是翻遍五个适配器。</p>\n<p>映射复杂度可以量化，用于排期和回归测试覆盖：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>map</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>channels</mtext></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>common</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mtext>required</mtext></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{map}} = \\sum_{c \\in \\text{channels}} \\left( |A_{\\text{common}}| + |A_c^{\\text{required}}| \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">map</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channels</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">common</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">required</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>common</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{common}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">common</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是跨渠道共用属性，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mtext>required</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_c^{\\text{required}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0961em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">required</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是渠道特有必填属性；后者随渠道政策变动而增长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分发拓扑的三种落地模式\">分发拓扑的三种落地模式</h2><p><strong>推模式（push）</strong>：PIM 在商品发布时主动调用渠道 API 或生成 feed 文件。优点是延迟可控，配合幂等键（通常用 <code>GTIN + 渠道 + 版本号</code>）可安全重试；缺点是 PIM 需要知道每个渠道的限流和配额，耦合较重。</p>\n<p><strong>拉模式（pull）</strong>：渠道按固定 URL 抓取 feed。中心只需保证文件在规定时刻已就绪且可访问，压力最小，但更新延迟以小时计，不适合秒杀类价格同步。Google Merchant Center 支持上传 feed 与 Content API 两种方式并用。</p>\n<p><strong>事件驱动</strong>：PIM 把 <code>ProductPublished</code> / <code>PriceChanged</code> / <code>InventoryUpdated</code> 作为事件写入日志，各渠道适配器独立消费。它天然支持<strong>重放</strong>——某个渠道因限流积压后，可以从 offset 重新消费而不影响其他渠道。代价是需要处理事件顺序与重复投递，适配器必须幂等。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;PIM 商品发布&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;写入变更事件日志&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C1[&quot;Google 适配器&lt;br/&gt;字段截断 150 字符&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C2[&quot;Meta 适配器&lt;br/&gt;校验 retailer_id&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C3[&quot;GDSN 适配器&lt;br/&gt;属性字典映射&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; D1{&quot;渠道回执&quot;}&#10;    C2 --&gt; D2{&quot;渠道回执&quot;}&#10;    C3 --&gt; D3{&quot;渠道回执&quot;}&#10;    D1 --&gt;|&quot;成功&quot;| E[&quot;标记同步完成&quot;]&#10;    D2 --&gt;|&quot;成功&quot;| E&#10;    D3 --&gt;|&quot;成功&quot;| E&#10;    D1 --&gt;|&quot;拒审&quot;| F[&quot;异常队列&lt;br/&gt;按错误码分流&quot;]&#10;    D2 --&gt;|&quot;拒审&quot;| F&#10;    D3 --&gt;|&quot;拒审&quot;| F&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;人工/自动修复&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"PIM 商品发布\"] --&gt; B[\"写入变更事件日志\"]\n    B --&gt; C1[\"Google 适配器&lt;br/&gt;字段截断 150 字符\"]\n    B --&gt; C2[\"Meta 适配器&lt;br/&gt;校验 retailer_id\"]\n    B --&gt; C3[\"GDSN 适配器&lt;br/&gt;属性字典映射\"]\n    C1 --&gt; D1{\"渠道回执\"}\n    C2 --&gt; D2{\"渠道回执\"}\n    C3 --&gt; D3{\"渠道回执\"}\n    D1 --&gt;|\"成功\"| E[\"标记同步完成\"]\n    D2 --&gt;|\"成功\"| E\n    D3 --&gt;|\"成功\"| E\n    D1 --&gt;|\"拒审\"| F[\"异常队列&lt;br/&gt;按错误码分流\"]\n    D2 --&gt;|\"拒审\"| F\n    D3 --&gt;|\"拒审\"| F\n    F --&gt; G[\"人工/自动修复\"]\n    G --&gt; B</pre><p>三条分支汇聚到同一套回执处理，是拓扑设计的一个硬性原则：<strong>回执处理应当统一，字段映射应当分散</strong>。因为错误码语义在各渠道是相似的（校验失败、库存冲突、图片不可达），而字段规则是渠道独有的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一致性模型与新鲜度\">一致性模型与新鲜度</h2><p>分发系统天然是最终一致的。PIM 提交后到渠道可见之间存在一个传播延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，它是排队时间、限流等待、渠道自身处理时间的和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>throttle</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>channel</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t = t_{\\text{queue}} + t_{\\text{throttle}} + t_{\\text{channel}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">throttle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">channel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>运维上把它转成 SLO：要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.99</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\Delta t \\le \\tau) \\ge 0.99</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span></span></span></span></span>，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = 15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟。这个比例比平均值有用得多——平均值会被大量快速成功的商品稀释，掩盖掉尾部积压。</p>\n<p>跨渠道副本之间还存在<strong>版本漂移</strong>。当商品被编辑两次（v1 → v2 → v3），某个渠道可能只收到了 v1 和 v3，也可能乱序收到 v3 再 v1。解决方式是给每条分发记录带上单调递增的版本号或逻辑时钟，渠道侧只接受版本号大于当前值的更新：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>apply</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>u</mi></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if ver</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>ver</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>drop</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{apply}(u) = \\begin{cases} u &amp; \\text{if } \\text{ver}(u) &gt; \\text{ver}(c) \\\\ \\text{drop} &amp; \\text{otherwise} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">apply</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">drop</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ver</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ver</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otherwise</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>同时，<strong>价格与库存不应走 PIM 的同一节奏</strong>。PIM 内容变更以天/小时计，而价格库存以秒计。把它们塞进同一条同步链路会导致内容编辑被高频价格更新淹没，或者价格更新被内容审核阻塞。成熟的做法是拆分两条链路：内容链路走 PIM 事件，交易链路走渠道原生的价格/库存 API（或专用端点）。</p>\n<p>校验与对账（reconciliation）是这套模型的收尾：定时把各渠道的<strong>实际在架商品集合</strong>拉回来，与主数据的<strong>应分发集合</strong>做差集，得到三类差异——应发未发、已发但渠道下架、渠道上有主数据不存在的孤儿商品。孤儿商品通常是重复 GTIN 或历史遗留，需要并入 Golden Record 去重流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分发工程由<strong>拓扑</strong>（谁向谁、什么节奏、什么协议）与<strong>真相源分层</strong>（哪层拥有哪个属性）共同定义，二者不可偏废。</li>\n<li>识别键（GTIN/GLN）是最先必须定死的层；校验位公式可独立验算，多数「渠道拒收」实为数据本身的校验失败。</li>\n<li>渠道目录应建模成 <code>channel × field → {required, maxLength, enum, transform, sourceLayer}</code> 的可查询矩阵，而非散落在适配器里的硬编码。</li>\n<li>中心辐射加事件驱动是当前主流：映射分散到各消费者、回执处理统一收敛，天然支持重放与幂等。</li>\n<li>一致性用尾部 SLO（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.99</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\Delta t \\le \\tau) \\ge 0.99</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span></span></span></span></span>）描述而非平均值；版本号或逻辑时钟解决跨渠道乱序。</li>\n<li>内容链路与价格库存链路应拆分，两者变更频率相差数个数量级。</li>\n<li>分发不是单向广播，回执与定期对账是必不可少的闭环；差异分三类（应发未发 / 渠道下架 / 孤儿商品）。</li>\n<li>渠道规范会漂移（如 Google 主图尺寸限制在 2027-01-31 收紧），能力矩阵集中建模让政策变更只改一处。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：本 hub 内 <a href=\"../feed-build-transform/\">Feed 构建与字段转换</a> 讲映射规则实现，<a href=\"../compliance-validation-quality/\">合规校验与质量</a> 讲校验门与拒审归因，<a href=\"../ack-reconciliation-ops/\">回执对账与运维</a> 讲对账流水线运行。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分发拓扑与商品主数据真相源","id":"分发拓扑与商品主数据真相源"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"真相源分层与 Golden Record 建模","id":"真相源分层与-golden-record-建模"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道目录与能力矩阵","id":"渠道目录与能力矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"分发拓扑的三种落地模式","id":"分发拓扑的三种落地模式"},{"level":2,"text":"一致性模型与新鲜度","id":"一致性模型与新鲜度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"渠道目录分类体系与能力矩阵建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/syndication-model-channel-catalog/channel-catalog-taxonomy-capability"}}